 text 初始场来源\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1329 pop up button (collapsed, settable) Value: 继承最新结果, ID: slv-start-from, Secondary Actions: Expand\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1330 menu\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1331 (selected) 继承最新结果\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1332 从 0 时刻起\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1333 firstTime\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1334 text 时间步模式\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1335 radio button (settable, integer) Description: 自适应, Value: 1\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1336 radio button (settable, integer) Description: 固定, Value: 0\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1337 text 初始时间步 (s)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1338 stepper (settable, float) Value: 0.009999999776482582, Details: 0.01, ID: slv-delta-t\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1339 text 最大时间步 (s)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1340 stepper (settable, float) Value: 0.009999999776482582, Details: 0.01, ID: slv-max-delta-t\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1341 text 最大Courant数\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1342 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 1, ID: slv-max-co\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1343 container write-interval-adaptive-row\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1344 text 写入间隔 (s)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1345 text 按物理时间\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1346 stepper (settable, float) Value: 0.009999999776482582, Details: 0.01, ID: slv-write-interval-s\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1347 text 时间离散格式\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1348 pop up button (collapsed, settable) Value: Euler (一阶), ID: slv-ddt-scheme, Secondary Actions: Expand\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1349 menu\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1350 (selected) Euler (一阶)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1351 backward (二阶)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1352 CrankNicolson (二阶)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1353 text 压力修正步数\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1354 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 2, ID: slv-n-correctors\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1355 text 写入精度设置\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1356 pop up button (collapsed, settable) Value: 双精度 (10), ID: slv-write-precision, Secondary Actions: Expand\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1357 menu\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1358 单精度 (6)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1359 (selected) 双精度 (10)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1360 text 并行求解\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1361 checkbox (settable, integer) Value: 1, ID: slv-parallel\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1362 text 2 核\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1363 text 求解核数\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1364 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 2, ID: slv-procs\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1365 text 求解核数可独立于网格生成核数设置；当前网格并行状态：\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1366 text 并行 2 核\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1367 container\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1368 text 🌍 重力设置 设置重力加速度方向和大小（m/s²），默认 Y 轴负方向（Y-up 坐标系）。 X\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1369 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 0, ID: slv-gx\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1370 text Y\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1371 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 0, ID: slv-gy\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1372 text Z\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1373 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 0, ID: slv-gz\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1374 container\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1375 text ⚙️ 求解精度预设\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1376 button 🚀 快速, ID: preset-fast\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1377 button ⚖️ 平衡, ID: preset-balanced\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1378 button 🎯 高精度, ID: preset-accurate\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1379 text 快速=一阶upwind | 平衡=二阶linearUpwind(推荐) | 高精度=三阶TVD 非正交修正\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1380 checkbox (settable, integer) Value: 0, ID: slv-nonortho\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1381 button (collapsed) 高级设置, ID: slv-advanced-toggle, Secondary Actions: Expand\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1382 container slv-convergence\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1383 text 📉 瞬态每步收敛阈值\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1384 text 每个时间步内反复外迭代，直到各变量迭代开始时的残差都低于阈值，或达到每步最大外迭代次数后进入下一步。动量预测关闭时 U 不单独求解，U 的阈值不生效。\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1385 text 每步最大外迭代\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1386 stepper (settable, integer) Value: 20, ID: slv-n-outer\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1387 text p_rgh (压力)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1388 text field (settable) Value: 0.001, ID: slv-tres-prgh\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1389 text U (速度)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1390 text field (settable) Value: 0.0001, ID: slv-tres-U\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1391 text T (温度)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1392 text field (settable) Value: 0.0001, ID: slv-tres-T\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t1393 text k / ε (湍流)\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t13